{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q5", "domain": "unknown", "question": "1993年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命盘分析，1993年流年癸酉，命主42岁，正值田宅大限（34-43岁）最后一年。流年命宫在酉，破军化禄与禄存、文曲化科同宫，有得财之象，但重点在于疾厄宫和夫妻宫的凶象。流年疾厄宫在原局夫妻宫（辰），天机化权与天梁、地劫同宫，主突发健康危机。更关键的是，流年癸干贪狼化忌在丑宫，与原局武曲同度；流年父母宫壬戌又引发武曲化忌，使丑宫武曲贪狼双化忌，冲射未宫（原局父母宫、流年夫妻宫）。未宫为空，被双忌直冲，主配偶大凶。原局夫妻宫天机天梁地劫，大限夫妻宫在巳，有文昌化忌，早已暗示婚姻波折及配偶健康隐患。迁移宫太阴化科无严重煞星，可排除交通意外；太阳在寅宫旺且化权，父亲星受克较轻。综合判断，丈夫病故的征象最为显著。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q5", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1c_R1_P1_G0\\details_2025_b1c_R1_P1_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 67097, "response_id": "2abb30db-0627-4ae3-b733-696f883c2688", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 735, "completion_tokens": 3981, "total_tokens": 4716, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 640}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3721}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 640, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 95}}
